  "description": "Se-Ra, who broke up with her boyfriend, whom she even thought about marrying, On the first day of my new job, I found the back of my boyfriend's head at my new job and quickly poured coffee on him. It turned out that the man I had never met before was my boss, whom I would have to see every day from now on?\n\nAn office romance comedy about Oh Se-Ra facing the biggest crisis of her life. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated and edited)",
